- Sending some amount shows trust and may encourage reciprocity
- Many experimental results show people do cooperate in these games

Since this is Round 1 and I have no history with this trustee, I'll take a moderately trusting approach. I'll send $3 as a signal of willingness to cooperate while not risking everything. This allows for mutual benefit if the trustee reciprocates, but doesn't leave me with nothing if they don't.

